  "title": "Avidbank Holdings, Inc. Announces Financial Results for the Second Quarter of 2026",
  "summary": "SAN JOSE, CA / ACCESS Newswire / July 23, 2026 / Avidbank Holdings, Inc. (NASDAQ:AVBH) (the \"Company\" or \"Avidbank Holdings\"), the holding company for Avidbank, a California state-chartered bank (the \"Bank\"), announced net income for the second quarter of 2026 of $7.6 million, or $0.71 per diluted share, compared to net income of $9.0 million, or $0.84 per diluted share, for the first quarter of 2026 and net income of $5.8 million, or $0.75 per diluted share, for the second quarter of 2025. Resu",
